  "notes": "Experimental feature in origin trial from Chrome 148 to 151 (HTMLInCanvas). Provides layoutsubtree attribute, drawElementImage for 2D canvas, texElementImage2D for WebGL, copyElementImageToTexture for WebGPU, and canvas.onpaint event to bridge DOM UI with hardware-accelerated canvas rendering. WebGPU naming carries a live divergence: the OT-era chromestatus record names device.copyElementImageToTexture (kept in the syntax table), while the current WICG explainer defines GPUQueue.drawElementImageToTexture(source, destination); the #examples WebGPU block shows the explainer shape and names both. Origin-trial range shown as the base stage 148-150 per the fetched record; extension stages run to 160."
}
